# ﾍﾙﾌﾟ > ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報 (menu 0x9c45) on SC0000 page 1. The game holds and its frame stays frozen, with no dim, while it is
# open, and OK closes it: the game goes on from the page it held on. Natively it is AGERC's dialog resource 2:
# `dialogs` lists its title, its static texts (the icon static's template name SYSTEM3 first) and OK, its only button,
# whose id is IDCANCEL (2). On the port it is the options panel at 情報, which names Open Maid Engine, the game and
# its diagnostics (docs/engine-re.md, "Native menu bar", 情報 names the port); `dialogs` lists the panel, and `answer
# OK` presses 決定, which applies nothing from ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報 without an edit, as AGERC's OK does.
# Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-version-dialog.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=60  # page 1
settle

menu version
wait 1.5
dialogs                                 # native: SYSTEM3, then the engine half's labels, OK; port: the panel at 情報
shot version-dialog
answer OK
wait 1
dialogs                                 # none
expect top=SC0000@0x83f
advance                                 # the game goes on
expect top=SC0000@0x874                 # page 2
